    "expectedResult": "Visual inspection remains advisory and the separate API Job fails visibly for its missing node; neither result substitutes for the other.",
    "expectedFailure": "Active-window routing, API-via-click fallback, repeated Computer observation, raw provider access, or output success inferred from the screenshot fails."
